\newlabel{tbl:accuracy-at-verdict}{{5}{13}{Per-method consensus accuracy at the verdict rate 0.800 with 95\% percentile-bootstrap CI, including the standard \protect \texttt {KLD} baseline. The CI is conditional on the seeded matched-trial design and resamples trials, not alternate world models. The standard pool sits at 0.9021 (\([0.8993, 0.9049]\)); the highest pooled robust mean among the configured members is 0.9867 (\([0.9865, 0.9869]\))}{tbl:accuracy-at-verdict}{}}
